y station is written by the fine-tuned model, and you can watch it happen live. Remove the model and there is no content at all, just an empty dial.…","Originality of concept A tuning-dial interface over a fine-tuned model, a hidden number-station cipher you actually solve, and a band that physically grows when you win.","Polish Custom CRT UI, precise tuning that stays where you leave it, a live \"capturing signal\" loading bar, per-station synthesized voices, Morse, an oscilloscope, and a scripted finale with credits."],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/build-small-hackathon/lost-frequency-radio/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"5da72bcb9e2d23356af65ad69592e52ecb5d6c863fb1ca9e3761b817c06e04bd","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T11:13:01.974Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T15:32:10.108Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An old radio that picks up broadcasts from parallel universes, written live by a 1-billion-parameter model running 100% on CPU, with no cloud APIs anywhere in the loop. Turn the dial. The voices are real-time. The wifi can be off.","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/build-small-hackathon/lost-frequency-radio/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"5da72bcb9e2d23356af65ad69592e52ecb5d6c863fb1ca9e3761b817c06e04bd","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/build-small-hackathon/lost-frequency-radio/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T15:32:10.108Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-06-15T14:37:32.000Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/build-small-hackathon/lost-frequency-radio/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T15:32:10.108Z","hash":"5da72bcb9e2d23356af65ad69592e52ecb5d6c863fb1ca9e3761b817c06e04bd","originalBytes":18398,"storedBytes":18398,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["model","radio","every","station","token","nbsp","static","frequency","one","live","never","broadcast","built","dial","gradio","gguf","python","same","w